<title>USA: Lino Lakes, Minn., $4.685 won by FBS Investments.</title>
<headline>Lino Lakes, Minn., $4.685 won by FBS Investments.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>FBS Investment Services Inc.</p>
<p>said it won $4.685 million of Lino Lakes, Minn., general</p>
<p>obligation improvement bonds, Series 1996 A, with a true</p>
<p>interest cost of 5.04 percent.</p>
</text>
